*.gds
*.lef
*.lib
*.cdl
*.spice
*.sp
*.oas
*.cir
# runner/driver intermediate sim artifacts (may quote native model text / device tokens)
*.log
*.ngspice.log
**/sizing_loop/
**/mc_runs/
**/corners/
**/signoff/
_logs/
